    "1.9 Bug 9 - Case Normalization exploration test": {
      "status": "passed",
      "failingExample": "All 5 test cases FAILED as expected on unfixed code, confirming Bug 9 exists:\n\n1. \"should match uppercase encoding names case-insensitively\" - FAILED\n   - Request with 'Accept-Encoding: GZIP' (uppercase)\n   - Expected: Content-Encoding header with compression\n   - Actual: No Content-Encoding header (no compression)\n   - Proves: Case-sensitive comparison fails to match \"GZIP\" vs \"gzip\"\n\n2. \"should match title-case encoding name Gzip\" - FAILED  \n   - Request with 'Accept-Encoding: Gzip' (title case)\n   - Expected: Content-Encoding header with compression\n   - Actual: No Content-Encoding header (no compression)\n   - Proves: Case-sensitive comparison fails to match \"Gzip\" vs \"gzip\"\n\n3. \"should match camel-case encoding name GZip\" - FAILED\n   - Request with 'Accept-Encoding: GZip' (camel case)\n   - Expected: Content-Encoding header with compression\n   - Actual: No Content-Encoding header (no compression)\n   - Proves: Case-sensitive comparison fails to match \"GZip\" vs \"gzip\"\n\n4. \"should match uppercase BR encoding name\" - FAILED\n   - Request with 'Accept-Encoding: BR' (uppercase)\n   - Expected: Content-Encoding header with brotli compression\n   - Actual: No Content-Encoding header (no compression)\n   - Proves: Case-sensitive comparison fails to match \"BR\" vs \"br\"\n\n5. \"should match mixed-case encodings in multi-encoding mode\" - FAILED\n   - Request with 'Accept-Encoding: GZIP, Br' (mixed cases)\n   - Expected: Content-Encoding header with either gzip or br\n   - Actual: No Content-Encoding header (no compression)\n   - Proves: Case-sensitive comparison fails for multiple mixed-case encodings\n\nRoot Cause: The encoding comparison in validateRequestPerAlgoAndUserAgent() uses case-sensitive in_array() check against request encodings without normalizing to lowercase first.\n\nExpected Fix: Normalize both the algorithm and request encodings to lowercase before comparison.",
      "lastRunTimestamp": 1793455074091
    },
    "1.10 Bug 10 - Brotli Detection exploration test": {
      "status": "passed",
      "failingExample": "Bug 10 exploration tests correctly FAIL on unfixed code, proving the bug exists:\n\n1. Empty string test: isBrotliEncoded(brotli_compress('')) returns false (should be true)\n2. Zero string test: isBrotliEncoded(brotli_compress('0')) returns false (should be true)  \n3. Decompression distinction test: Cannot distinguish valid empty/zero from decompression failure\n4. Edge cases test: Fails for empty string and '0' content\n\nRoot cause confirmed: src/Support/Enc.php line 26 explicitly rejects '' and '0' results:\n`return ! in_array($uncompressed, ['', '0'], true) && $uncompressed !== false;`\n\nThese are valid decompression results that should return true. The tests will PASS once the bug is fixed by changing the logic to: `return $uncompressed !== false;`",
      "lastRunTimestamp": 1793455294162
    },
